msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/interlace_field_order.rst:43
msgid ""
"This effect/filter transforms the :term:`field order` of the (interlaced) "
"input video."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter transformuje :term:`field order` (prekladaného) vstupného "
"videa."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/interlace_field_order.rst:45
msgid ""
"The transformation is done by shifting the picture content up or down by one "
"line, and filling the remaining line with appropriate picture content. This "
"method is consistent with most broadcast field order converters."
msgstr ""
"Transformácia sa vykonáva posunutím obsahu obrazu nahor alebo nadol o jeden "
"riadok a vyplnením zostávajúceho riadka vhodným obsahom obrazu. Táto metóda "
"je konzistentná s väčšinou vysielacích konvertorov poradia polí."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/interlace_field_order.rst:47
msgid ""
"If the input video is not flagged as being :term:`interlaced`, or it is "
"already flagged as being of the required output field order, then this "
"filter does not alter the incoming video."
msgstr ""
"Ak vstupné video nie je označené ako :term:`interlaced` alebo je už označené "
"ako video s požadovaným poradím výstupných polí, tento filter vstupné video "
"nemení."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/interlace_field_order.rst:49
msgid ""
"It is very useful when converting to or from PAL DV material, which is "
"bottom field first."
msgstr ""
"Je veľmi užitočný pri konverzii do alebo z materiálu PAL DV, ktorý má "
"poradie polí bottom field first."

